│ clinical utility of the geriatric self‐efficacy index for urinary incontinence", "abstract": "OBJECTIVES To report   │
│ on the responsiveness testing and clinical utility of the 12-item Geriatric Self-Efficacy Index for Urinary          │
│ Incontinence (GSE-UI). DESIGN Prospective cohort study. SETTING Six urinary incontinence (UI) outpatient clinics in  │
