nonsurgical treatment for this condition.Taylor & Francis Online"}, {"study_index": 25, "title": "Controlled trial of   
pelvic floor exercises in the treatment of urinary stress incontinence in general practice", "abstract": "The aim of    
this study was to assess the usefulness of pelvic floor exercises in the treatment of urinary incontinence in women and 
to analyse the factors which determine a successful outcome. The study involved 66 women who had reported \'genuine     
